# The engine's sources are hashed into its version (sim-cpp/Makefile `make version`, server/codecraft/builder.py):
# the same bytes in every checkout, Windows included, where git would otherwise turn their LF into CRLF.
sim-cpp/** -text
# bash takes its scripts with LF only (MSYS2's bash runs .github/runner-game.sh on Windows)
*.sh text eol=lf
